From 939146223006e44cbb32d0f70d5f79bcde713543 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:24:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] API 43 (FORK-10 d2): players.open-entity-menu, a mod entity's
 container as a chest

The entity's first rows of 9 slots open as a chest menu (generic_9xN) under a placeholder key, as chest boats and minecarts do: the player moves items as in a chest, the menu and the entity follow each other every tick (what the player put reaches the mod's tick, what the mod put shows), the menu closes past 4 blocks from the entity's box or when it goes, and closing writes the slots back.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
